<Layout title="About Us">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-2 py-6 pb-8">
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2 pb-2">About Us</h1>

        <p class="text-gray-700">Icy Electronics established in 2025, and is headquatered in Cannes, France. Icy Electronics keeps things cool by developing innovative electronics. We offer compact, familiar designs ready for integration into existing projects and enclosures, promoting the re-use of electronics and preventing more waste from being born. We have expertice in high-speed digital designs and development boards, and provide full-solutions to solve read-world challenges</p>
        <p class="pt-2 text-gray-700">In addition, we also provide fun electronics gadgets oriented towards makers, stuends and hardware enthusiasts. Some of our products might seemingly come out of nowhere, yet they all have a common aspect: Fun.</p>
    </div>
</Layout>
